{"text": "Your personality creates your personal reality. Most people never realize this.\n\nThe life you are living right now \u2014 the people around you, the experiences you attract \u2014 is a reflection of one thing. How you think, how you act, how you feel. That is your personality.\n\nSo begin to notice your inner world. Become aware of the thoughts that repeat when no one is watching. Watch how you speak, how you react, how you carry yourself. Notice which emotion you live in every day.\n\nSome people live in guilt, or in anger, for so long that they begin to believe that is who they are. It is not who you are. It is only who you have been practicing to be.\n\nWhen you start observing yourself, you rise above your old patterns. A new thought leads to a new choice. A new choice becomes a new action. A new action brings a new experience. And the body begins to feel what the mind has learned. That is how change becomes real.\n\nComment practice, and I will send you the first one.\n\nNoticing the pattern is where this begins. It is not where it ends \u2014 the body needs far longer than a moment to believe you. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["Y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "p", "e", "r", "s", "o", "n", "a", "l", "i", "t", "y", " ", "c", "r", "e", "a", "t", "e", "s", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "p", "e", "r", "s", "o", "n", "a", "l", " ", "r", "e", "a", "l", "i", "t", "y", ".", " ", "M", "o", "s", "t", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "n", "e", "v", "e", "r", " ", "r", "e", "a", "l", "i", "z", "e", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "h", "e", " ", "l", "i", "f", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "l", "i", "v", "i", "n", "g", " ", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "n", "o", "w", " ", "\u2014", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "y", "o", "u", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "x", "p", "e", "r", "